To change names of the PDBs, I added the geometry back to the files which are in sorted order.

I then used the geometry name to call the file from the pdb directory in the following format:
 - path/to/pdb/dir/{sequence}/{id}.pdb

Where geometry is broken down into:
 - sequence: the amino acid sequence 
 - id: the unique identifier for the PDB file

I then moved that file to a new directory with the new name as the sample name:
 - path/to/new/pdb/dir/{sample}.pdb

PDB directories: 
 - 2024-4-3_bbOptimizaterReruns
 - 2023-8-28_pdbBBRepack
    - leu: all_leu_wts, leu_mutants
    - ala: ala_all, ala_mutants